	●	Which exact source version is deployed, and which API keys and Redis settings are active? Never disclose key values.  
	●	Why did the reviewed payment return to Scan without recording a transaction?  
	●	Do current distance and budget filters use reliable merchant facts, and which ranking provider answered the observed Subway result?  
	●	Can any real NETS payment event be linked to user and merchant/outlet identity for verification? The prototype currently simulates payments; QR merchant identification alone does not verify one.  
	●	Which credit and referral incentives are worth their merchant cost, and does Vouch cause incremental NETS choice rather than just attributing an existing visit?  
	●	Should publicity say “NETS Vouch AI” now, or describe the AI roadmap while naming the current tested functionality? Base wording on a deployed end-to-end demonstration.  
  
